                                       rdfs:range <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Geometry> ;
                                       rdfs:label "has geometry"@en .


###  https://cropontology.org/rdf/method_of
<https://cropontology.org/rdf/method_of> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
