#################################################################

###  http://purl.org/NET/scovo#Dataset
<http://purl.org/NET/scovo#Dataset> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                    owl:equivalentClass <http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#DataSet> .


###  http://purl.org/NET/scovo#Item
<http://purl.org/NET/scovo#Item> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                 owl:equivalentClass <http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#Observation> .


###  http://purl.org/dc/dcam/VocabularyEncodingScheme
<http://purl.org/dc/dcam/VocabularyEncodingScheme> rdf:type owl:Class .


