###  https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/LegalEntities/LEIEntities/RelationshipStatusActive
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/LegalEntities/LEIEntities/RelationshipStatusActive> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                           <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/LegalEntities/LEIEntities/RelationshipStatus> ;
