                                                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Two days before the end of a calendar month." .


###  https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/DatesAndTimes/FinancialDates/FromStart
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/DatesAndTimes/FinancialDates/FromStart> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/DatesAndTimes/FinancialDates/TimeDirection> ;
