                                                                                           <https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/AnnotationVocabulary/explanatoryNote> "Informative content will be removed as soon as all dependencies have been eliminated, thus FIBO users should not depend on it going forward."@en .


###  https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional
<https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                    <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Utilities/AnnotationVocabulary/MaturityLevel> ;
